{"id":"e035b6756930dcca","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-terminal-pullbacks-finite-limits.md","title":"Theorem — Finite Limits from a Terminal Object and Pullbacks","display":"Theorem — Finite Limits from a Terminal Object and Pullbacks","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-terminal-pullbacks-finite-limits","aliases":["14-thm-terminal-pullbacks-finite-limits"],"display":"Theorem — Finite Limits from a Terminal Object and Pullbacks","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-terminal-pullbacks-finite-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-terminal-pullbacks-finite-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Finite Limits from a Terminal Object and Pullbacks"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是范畴；有限极限谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to C\">\\(f:A\\to C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:B\\to C\">\\(g:B\\to C\\)</span> 在相应量词内解释；积和拉回见所列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,C)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\ \\exists P,p,q\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(P,p,q,f,g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,C)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\ \\exists P,p,q\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(P,p,q,f,g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries 的终对象、积、拉回、等化子与有限图，印刷页 14–17、20–21；DjVu 第 13–14、16 图页。以下组合这些普遍构造给出证明。有限极限当然包含空图和拉回图。反向，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\">\\(A\\times B\\)</span> 是两条到终对象箭头的拉回；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v:A\\to B\">\\(u,v:A\\to B\\)</span> 的等化子是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle:A\\to B\\times B\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle:A\\to B\\times B\\)</span> 与对角的拉回。任一有限图的极限可取对象有限积到箭头目标有限积的两条映射之等化子，故终对象加拉回足够。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是范畴；有限极限谓词见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。$f:A\\to C$、$g:B\\to C$ 在相应量词内解释；积和拉回见所列依赖。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"g:B\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,C)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\ \\exists P,p,q\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(P,p,q,f,g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"u,v:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle:A\\to B\\times B","display":false}],"bytes":1643,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-terminal-pullbacks-finite-limits|Theorem — Finite Limits from a Terminal Object and Pullbacks]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正